 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "WorkerManagementSystem() starts empty. addWorker(workerId, position, compensation) adds a worker and returns true, or returns false and changes nothing when the id exists. registerWorker(workerId, timestamp) returns \"invalid_request\" for an unknown worker; otherwise it records an entry when the worker is outside the office and an exit when inside, and returns \"registered\". registerWorker timestamps strictly increase. get(workerId) returns the total length (exit - entry) of the worker's finished sessions, or -1 for an unknown worker; an open session does not count.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk10-b-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
